# Coverage slice (#258): legal identity.
# Exercises legalIdentifier, identifierScheme, and the scheme-required shape.

@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/organizations/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .

# Well-formed: identifier + scheme.
ex:acme a gmeow:Organization ;
    gmeow:legalIdentifier "ROR-ABCDE" ;
    gmeow:identifierScheme "ror" .

# Malformed: identifier without scheme (should trigger violation).
ex:badCo a gmeow:Organization ;
    gmeow:legalIdentifier "MY-COMPANY-123" .
